catalog: Panel
target: treeref panel
summary: The treeref panel type

!! Commands

* ``treeref:add`` — TreeRef explorer: add an element under the current node
* ``treeref:descend`` — TreeRef explorer: descend into the selected node
* ``treeref:find`` — TreeRef explorer: jump to a child by name
* ``treeref:first`` — TreeRef explorer: move to the first child
* ``treeref:last`` — TreeRef explorer: move to the last loaded child
* ``treeref:list-refs`` — TreeRef explorer: list the metarecords pointing at the selected node (here / other / new)
* ``treeref:next`` — TreeRef explorer: move the cursor down
* ``treeref:parent`` — TreeRef explorer: go up one level
* ``treeref:prev`` — TreeRef explorer: move the cursor up
* ``treeref:refresh`` — TreeRef explorer: reload from the daemon
* ``treeref:root`` — TreeRef explorer: jump to the forest roots
* ``treeref:set`` — TreeRef explorer: change a view setting
* ``treeref:toggle`` — TreeRef explorer: toggle a view flag (scope: the exact node ⇄ its whole subtree)
